{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "LaughterLost",
    "steam_appid": 2858420,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858420/extras/About-Section.JPG?t=1720830883\" /></span><br><br>LaughterLost plunges you into a surreal journey through the complexities of work and family life in a dystopian world. Face psychological twists and turn the tide of your destiny through narrative decisions. Navigate challenging puzzles and unexpected unique confrontations! Each choice you make shapes your experience in this enthralling cycle of everyday trials. Will you uncover the path to perseverance or succumb to the pressures of this warped existence? Explore the depths of LaughterLost and discover if you can survive. Will you break this dystopian cycle of life?<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858420/extras/Edited.JPG?t=1720830883\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858420/extras/f6d3b556a1da7fc5f0166144f19bc071.poster.avif?t=1720830883\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858420/extras/f6d3b556a1da7fc5f0166144f19bc071.webm?t=1720830883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858420/extras/f6d3b556a1da7fc5f0166144f19bc071.mp4?t=1720830883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br> <strong>Engaging Narrative Story</strong><br>Engage in narrative decisions that will make or break you, in your journey through family and work life. Can you defend your livelihood in this cruel, unforgiving world?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858420/extras/43f4499b58fd7fd8bea84b3a76c6a031.poster.avif?t=1720830883\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858420/extras/43f4499b58fd7fd8bea84b3a76c6a031.webm?t=1720830883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858420/extras/43f4499b58fd7fd8bea84b3a76c6a031.mp4?t=1720830883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Solve Intricate Puzzles</strong><br>Navigate intricate puzzles that challenge your problem-solving skills in this surreal and dystopian world. Solving puzzles advances you through the narrative while you discover the mysteries of this cycle of everyday existence.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858420/extras/3d59ff528c74db1bcce30bc1ecf4bd7f.poster.avif?t=1720830883\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858420/extras/3d59ff528c74db1bcce30bc1ecf4bd7f.webm?t=1720830883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858420/extras/3d59ff528c74db1bcce30bc1ecf4bd7f.mp4?t=1720830883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>BECOME the Final Boss</strong><br>Confront unique and intense confrontations that epitomize the distinctive challenges of your character's dystopian journey. Test your skills against unexpected foes, introducing dramatic twists in an already twisted world<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858420/extras/About-Dev.JPG?t=1720830883\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br><strong>Message from Mix Studio:</strong><br><br><i>&quot;Exploring the diverse facets of laughter inspired by the theme, our team discussed various ways and meanings of smiling, embarking on a journey to dissect its complexities. We pondered the nuances of genuine laughter born from humor and joy, juxtaposed with the fa\u00e7ade of artificial smiles often worn in social settings or to mask inner turmoil. Our exploration led us to the perspective of a middle-class worker facing the imminent threat of job loss. In this narrative, we unveiled different kinds of smiles: the obligatory smile in the presence of superiors, the strained smiles concealing stress, and the genuine moments of joy shared with loved ones, such as his daughter.<br><br>Our main goal is to discover the multifaceted nature of smiles and delve into broader societal themes. Through gameplay, we aim to provoke contemplation on labor challenges and the pervasive drinking culture prevalent in China.&quot;</i><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858420/extras/7319def446e554a1d24f2e99c6272596.avif?t=1720830883\" width=600 height=100 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858420/extras/About-Section.JPG?t=1720830883\" /></span><br><br>LaughterLost plunges you into a surreal journey through the complexities of work and family life in a dystopian world. Face psychological twists and turn the tide of your destiny through narrative decisions. Navigate challenging puzzles and unexpected unique confrontations! Each choice you make shapes your experience in this enthralling cycle of everyday trials. Will you uncover the path to perseverance or succumb to the pressures of this warped existence? Explore the depths of LaughterLost and discover if you can survive. Will you break this dystopian cycle of life?<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858420/extras/Edited.JPG?t=1720830883\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858420/extras/f6d3b556a1da7fc5f0166144f19bc071.poster.avif?t=1720830883\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858420/extras/f6d3b556a1da7fc5f0166144f19bc071.webm?t=1720830883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858420/extras/f6d3b556a1da7fc5f0166144f19bc071.mp4?t=1720830883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br> <strong>Engaging Narrative Story</strong><br>Engage in narrative decisions that will make or break you, in your journey through family and work life. Can you defend your livelihood in this cruel, unforgiving world?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858420/extras/43f4499b58fd7fd8bea84b3a76c6a031.poster.avif?t=1720830883\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858420/extras/43f4499b58fd7fd8bea84b3a76c6a031.webm?t=1720830883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858420/extras/43f4499b58fd7fd8bea84b3a76c6a031.mp4?t=1720830883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Solve Intricate Puzzles</strong><br>Navigate intricate puzzles that challenge your problem-solving skills in this surreal and dystopian world. Solving puzzles advances you through the narrative while you discover the mysteries of this cycle of everyday existence.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858420/extras/3d59ff528c74db1bcce30bc1ecf4bd7f.poster.avif?t=1720830883\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858420/extras/3d59ff528c74db1bcce30bc1ecf4bd7f.webm?t=1720830883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858420/extras/3d59ff528c74db1bcce30bc1ecf4bd7f.mp4?t=1720830883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>BECOME the Final Boss</strong><br>Confront unique and intense confrontations that epitomize the distinctive challenges of your character's dystopian journey. Test your skills against unexpected foes, introducing dramatic twists in an already twisted world<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858420/extras/About-Dev.JPG?t=1720830883\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br><strong>Message from Mix Studio:</strong><br><br><i>&quot;Exploring the diverse facets of laughter inspired by the theme, our team discussed various ways and meanings of smiling, embarking on a journey to dissect its complexities. We pondered the nuances of genuine laughter born from humor and joy, juxtaposed with the fa\u00e7ade of artificial smiles often worn in social settings or to mask inner turmoil. Our exploration led us to the perspective of a middle-class worker facing the imminent threat of job loss. In this narrative, we unveiled different kinds of smiles: the obligatory smile in the presence of superiors, the strained smiles concealing stress, and the genuine moments of joy shared with loved ones, such as his daughter.<br><br>Our main goal is to discover the multifaceted nature of smiles and delve into broader societal themes. Through gameplay, we aim to provoke contemplation on labor challenges and the pervasive drinking culture prevalent in China.&quot;</i><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858420/extras/7319def446e554a1d24f2e99c6272596.avif?t=1720830883\" width=600 height=100 /></span>",
